WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:05.433
A few days later, Gildong was in the town near the hideout.

2
00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:14.335
The Hwalbindang were giving grain and cloth to the poor.

3
00:00:14.336 --> 00:00:20.173
"Hong Gildong!" an old man said. "You're our hero!"

4
00:00:20.174 --> 00:00:24.806
Gildong smiled.

5
00:00:24.807 --> 00:00:28.991
He handed a sack of rice to the candlemaker.

6
00:00:28.992 --> 00:00:32.859
"Thank you for helping me again!" the young man said.

7
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:36.755
"I wish we could help more people," Nabi said.

8
00:00:36.756 --> 00:00:40.339
"Me too." Mok smiled.

9
00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.588
"But we have only one boss.

10
00:00:42.589 --> 00:00:46.583
Wouldn't it be great if there were two Gildongs?"

11
00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:52.931
Gildong laughed. "Sorry. There's only one of me."

12
00:00:52.932 --> 00:00:59.513
But Mok's joke gave Gildong an idea.

13
00:00:59.514 --> 00:01:06.096
Back at the hideout, he gathered some straw and started making something.

14
00:01:06.097 --> 00:01:13.271
When he was done, there were seven figures made of straw.

15
00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:19.895
Nabi laughed. "Can I play with your dolls?"

16
00:01:19.896 --> 00:01:23.615
"They're not dolls," Gildong said.

17
00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:30.282
He opened his fan. "Come to life!"

18
00:01:30.283 --> 00:01:36.433
The figures suddenly sprang up.

19
00:01:36.434 --> 00:01:40.318
Now they looked just like Gildong.

20
00:01:40.319 --> 00:01:45.944
Nabi's eyes went wide. "Amazing!"

21
00:01:45.945 --> 00:01:52.247
"Whoa!" Mok cried. "There are seven more Gildongs!"

22
00:01:52.248 --> 00:01:57.204
Gildong nodded and turned back to his creations.

23
00:01:57.205 --> 00:02:00.310
"Each of you will lead a Hwalbindang group.

24
00:02:00.311 --> 00:02:03.414
Go out to every part of the country.

25
00:02:03.415 --> 00:02:04.961
Remember our role.

26
00:02:04.962 --> 00:02:08.929
We punish bad officials and help the poor."

27
00:02:08.930 --> 00:02:19.218
The Gildongs all puffed out their chests. "Yes, sir!"

28
00:02:19.219 --> 00:02:24.392
Every day the king heard new reports of the Hwalbindang.

29
00:02:24.393 --> 00:02:28.147
They robbed government storehouses all over the country.

30
00:02:28.148 --> 00:02:34.328
They stole from nobles everywhere.

31
00:02:34.329 --> 00:02:41.508
The king scowled when Police Chief Heup arrived at the palace.

32
00:02:41.509 --> 00:02:49.233
"You fool. You didn't capture Gildong, and now he seems to be everywhere!

33
00:02:49.234 --> 00:02:54.536
How can he be in eight places in one day?"

34
00:02:54.537 --> 00:02:58.819
"I'm sorry, Your Majesty." Heup looked down.

35
00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:02.120
"I have failed to capture Gildong so far.

36
00:03:02.121 --> 00:03:04.516
But I am on his trail.

37
00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:09.150
In fact, I just learned something new about the boy.

38
00:03:09.151 --> 00:03:14.833
Hong Gildong is the lowborn son of Lord Hong."

39
00:03:14.834 --> 00:03:22.515
"What?" the king roared. "Bring Lord Hong here now!"

40
00:03:22.516 --> 00:03:25.222
"Actually, sir," Heup said.

41
00:03:25.223 --> 00:03:28.273
"Perhaps we should place him under house arrest.

42
00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:34.785
When Gildong hears about the arrest, he'll go to his father's home."

43
00:03:34.786 --> 00:03:45.237
The king looked pleased. "We'll capture him then for sure!"

44
00:03:45.238 --> 00:03:52.765
One morning Gildong saw Nabi running to him.

45
00:03:52.766 --> 00:03:58.065
"Little lord! I've heard terrible news about your father," she said.

46
00:03:58.066 --> 00:04:01.751
"The king found out you're Lord Hong's son.

47
00:04:01.752 --> 00:04:05.920
Your father is under house arrest."

48
00:04:05.921 --> 00:04:08.205
Gildong jumped up.

49
00:04:08.206 --> 00:04:13.085
"I have to go to him. I need to fix this."

50
00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:30.751
He took out his fan. "To Lord Hong's house!"

